  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool2/). VERDICT: STALE-FIXED. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e. Fixed by 181251b5dc (2026-10-17): staleness_distance() subtracts count_tracker_only_commits(), matched by commit SUBJECT (^tracker(scope)?:) rather than the path predicate the item proposed. Live: `scripts/generate-architecture --check` -> 'OK: ... generated 3 commit(s) ago (window 30) (7 including 4 tracker-only commit(s), not counted)'. Residual nit: the comment above RECENT_COMMIT_WINDOW (lines 75-79) still says excluding them was 'filed separately'. MECHANISM: recency window counted every commit; now subtracts tracker-only commits (subject regex ^tracker(\\(..\\))?:). PROPOSED DISPOSITION: close (awaiting owner authorization; status unchanged)."  # 7675
